<title>USA: Procter &amp; Gamble Q3 March 31 net rises.</title>
<headline>Procter &amp; Gamble Q3 March 31 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Procter &amp; Gamble Company</p>
<p>Millions of Dollars Except Per Share Amounts</p>
<p>					    Three Months Ended March 31</p>
<p>					     1997	 1996   % Change</p>
<p> Net Sales				$8,771    $8,587	   2%</p>
<p> Operating Income			1,383     1,193	  16%</p>
